@page "/terms"

<PageTitle>ShopHub - Terms & Conditions</PageTitle>

<div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <section>
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By creating an account or using ShopHub, you agree to these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the platform.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>2. Accounts</h2>
        <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and password. You agree to provide accurate information when creating an account and to keep it up to date.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>3. Selling on ShopHub</h2>
        <p>Sellers are responsible for the accuracy of their product listings, including descriptions, prices and images. Prohibited items and misleading listings are not allowed and may result in account suspension.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>4. Orders & Payments</h2>
        <p>When you place an order, you agree to pay the listed price plus any applicable delivery fees. Prices are displayed in Naira (₦).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>5. Returns & Refunds</h2>
        <p>If an item arrives damaged or not as described, contact support within 7 days of delivery for a return or refund.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>ShopHub acts as a marketplace connecting buyers and sellers. We are not responsible for disputes between buyers and sellers beyond our stated policies.</p>
    </section>
</div>

